      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPER ON TIME (1) recorded a win over 400m at Bulli in a powerful 22.20 last start. Top win latest and looms as the one to beat again. BABY FACE BANDIT (4) goes very well this course and distance starting 10 times for four wins and four minors. Placed last time (29.72) at this track in a Grade 4/5, finishing second and beaten half a length. Looks suited here and can measure up. MAGIC BANDIT (2) was safely held last time out, finishing sixth at this track over 520m behind Jungle Johnny (29.97) in a NG. The form out of last race has been strong. Great chance to atone. LATE IN WINTER (7) continues to race well and is sure to be competitive again.",
